# Enemy_Slime - the green gumdrop slime (Tools/Blender/enemies/models_enemies.py slime()): one glossy jelly body
# with a small sprout tip, big "cute" eyes (light sclera, dark indigo pupil, glint), a small dark smile and pink blush.
# 3/4 view turned to the viewer's right: the face sits right of centre, the far eye is narrower.
size 48 48
symmetric x
key
  O #143a2c  outline (darkest green, cool)
  D #1d6b47  core shadow, sel-out line round the eyes
  S #32994c  shadow / reflected light
  G #4ebb54  jelly base (palette green 10)
  L #88d766  lit plane (warmer)
  H #dff9b4  gloss
  E #e4e7f3  eye white (cool)
  P #21182c  pupil (palette indigo 1)
  W #ffffff  eye glint
  M #3f1a20  mouth
  B #e88aa6  blush, tongue
